{'symbol': 'V', 'date': '2022-03-02 10:00:00', 'title': 'VISA NAMES FRANK COOPER III GLOBAL CHIEF MARKETING OFFICER', 'text': "SAN FRANCISCO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--VISA (NYSE: V) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT FRANK COOPER III WILL JOIN THE COMPANY AS CHIEF MARKETING OFFICER (CMO) IN MAY 2022. MR. COOPER WILL ALSO SERVE AS A MEMBER OF THE COMPANY'S EXECUTIVE COMMITTEE AND REPORT TO CHAIRMAN AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER (CEO), AL KELLY. “FRANK IS A RARE MIX OF CREATIVE BRAND STRATEGIST WITH STRONG BUSINESS ACUMEN AND A LEADER WHO UNDERSTANDS THE DEEPER BRAND OPPORTUNITY THAT COMES FROM LEADING WITH PURPOSE,” SAID AL KELLY, CHAIRMAN AND"}